        "text": "```\n1 | 2   3  -8   3\n  |     2   5  -3\n  |_____________\n    2   5  -3   0\n```\n\nStep by step:\n1. Bring down 2\n2. $1 \\times 2 = 2$, add to 3: $3 + 2 = 5$\n3. $1 \\times 5 = 5$, add to -8: $-8 + 5 = -3$\n4. $1 \\times (-3) = -3$, add to 3: $3 + (-3) = 0$",
